<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Latinvest cuts Quilmes.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Latinvest cuts Quilmes.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Latinvest analyst Jason Belmont said he reduced Quilmes Industrial SA to hold from long-term buy.</p>
<p>- Latinvest downgraded its 1996 and 1997 earnings per share for Quilmes to $0.65 and $0.72, respectively, from $0.72 and $0.78, following the company's first-half 1996 results.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
